{"fps": 30, "frames": 1544, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 128, "text": "The investors who worked hardest at the stock market earned the least.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 0, "e": 2}, {"w": "investors", "f": 5, "e": 21}, {"w": "who", "f": 23, "e": 25}, {"w": "worked", "f": 30, "e": 34}, {"w": "hardest", "f": 37, "e": 46}, {"w": "at", "f": 48, "e": 50}, {"w": "the", "f": 51, "e": 53}, {"w": "stock", "f": 55, "e": 62}, {"w": "market", "f": 64, "e": 73}, {"w": "earned", "f": 80, "e": 87}, {"w": "the", "f": 88, "e": 89}, {"w": "least.", "f": 91, "e": 105}]}, {"a": 128, "b": 270, "text": "Imagine it's the early nineties. You're Dave, calling your broker every week.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 130, "e": 142}, {"w": "it's", "f": 144, "e": 147}, {"w": "the", "f": 149, "e": 151}, {"w": "early", "f": 153, "e": 160}, {"w": "nineties.", "f": 162, "e": 178}, {"w": "You're", "f": 190, "e": 194}, {"w": "Dave,", "f": 197, "e": 213}, {"w": "calling", "f": 217, "e": 222}, {"w": "your", "f": 223, "e": 224}, {"w": "broker", "f": 226, "e": 238}, {"w": "every", "f": 240, "e": 249}, {"w": "week.", "f": 251, "e": 261}]}, {"a": 270, "b": 419, "text": "Buy this, sell that. Your portfolio turns over more than twice a year.", "words": [{"w": "Buy", "f": 272, "e": 277}, {"w": "this,", "f": 279, "e": 293}, {"w": "sell", "f": 295, "e": 302}, {"w": "that.", "f": 306, "e": 313}, {"w": "Your", "f": 325, "e": 329}, {"w": "portfolio", "f": 331, "e": 347}, {"w": "turns", "f": 350, "e": 359}, {"w": "over", "f": 362, "e": 366}, {"w": "more", "f": 368, "e": 370}, {"w": "than", "f": 373, "e": 379}, {"w": "twice", "f": 382, "e": 389}, {"w": "a", "f": 391, "e": 393}, {"w": "year.", "f": 395, "e": 405}]}, {"a": 419, "b": 510, "text": "Your neighbor Pat barely touches the phone.", "words": [{"w": "Your", "f": 421, "e": 423}, {"w": "neighbor", "f": 425, "e": 432}, {"w": "Pat", "f": 434, "e": 446}, {"w": "barely", "f": 453, "e": 462}, {"w": "touches", "f": 464, "e": 473}, {"w": "the", "f": 474, "e": 475}, {"w":